# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local overrides. Copy to `.env` — everything here is optional.
# `.env` is gitignored; nothing in it should be needed for the suite to run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Which portal build to test — a key in config/portals.ts, generated from
# test-builds/. Defaults to `slack`.
# PORTAL=slack

# Port the portal dev server listens on. Defaults to 3000.
# PORTAL_PORT=3000

# Drive a clone of apimatic-dx-portal-v2 you already have, instead of the one
# `pnpm setup:portal` manages in .portal/. Handy when you're changing the portal
# and want to test against your working tree.
# PORTAL_REPO=D:\apimatic-dx-portal-v2

# Test a portal ref other than the one pinned in config/portal-source.json,
# without editing that file. A branch name or a commit SHA.
#   PORTAL_REF=apimatic-docs pnpm setup:portal
# PORTAL_REF=

# Point the tests at a URL that's already serving — a deployed preview, say.
# Skips generating and serving entirely.
# PORTAL_BASE_URL=https://some-preview.vercel.app
